    "offer_brief": "Aureon Global is a performance partner for real estate agents. We run seller outreach in the agent's own zip code and hand them booked listing appointments; the agent takes the appointments, we do the finding. How it works: (1) we set up a branded Home Value page for the agent, their name and brand, that homeowners in their zip use to get a quick value estimate, which captures real sellers who raise their hand; (2) we seed it with for-sale-by-owner and expired-listing owners already in that zip, plus estate and probate referral sources nearby, people who have shown they want to sell; (3) we reach out to those sellers on the agent's behalf, qualify them, and book the listing appointment straight onto the agent's calendar. No cold-calling strangers, only people showing real intent. Terms: we run it as a 3 month test. The agent gets the leads and booked appointments the whole time, and in return gives an honest review at the end so Aureon has a real result to show the next agent. No big upfront commitment."
  },
  "_architecture_note": [
    "Per-persona reputation isolation: each persona sends from a unique address on a",
    "dedicated subdomain (mail.aureonglobal.de) verified at Resend. No Hostinger mailbox",
    "is required behind these From: addresses because Resend owns the SMTP egress.",
    "Replies route back via Hostinger's normal MX on aureonglobal.de â€” the user adds an",
    "ImprovMX-style forwarder (or Cloudflare Email Routing) on mail.aureonglobal.de later",
    "if they want replies to a different inbox; for now Reply-To = info@aureonglobal.de."
